<title>AUSTRALIA: Singleton to raise A$4.57 mln in issue.</title>
<headline>Singleton to raise A$4.57 mln in issue.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advertising group Singleton Group Ltd said on Friday it plans to issue 1.1 million shares at a price of A$4.15 each to raise A$4.57 million.</p>
<p>&quot;The purpose of the issue is to fund possible future acquisitions but at present no specific acquisitions are being considered,&quot; Singleton said.</p>
<p>At 12.50 p.m. (0250 GMT), Singleton shares were 15.5 cents higher at A$4.605.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
